## Install xCAT on *Head Node*

With the OpenHPC and xCAT repositories enabled, install the xCAT provisioning
system:

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment Install xCAT provisioning services -->
```bash
# Install xCAT
{{ pkg_install }} xCAT
```
<!-- ohpc_command export XCATROOT=/opt/xcat -->
<!-- ohpc_command export PATH=$XCATROOT/bin:$XCATROOT/sbin:$XCATROOT/share/xcat/tools:$PATH -->
<!-- ohpc_command export PERL_BADLANG=0 -->
<!-- ohpc_end -->

Source the environment script to make the xCAT tools available in the current
shell (new login shells pick this up automatically):

```bash
. /etc/profile.d/xcat.sh
```
